{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In their hunger for immortality humanity fought &quot;Death the Aeon&quot; but the battle was lost.. their hope was shattered.. and a curse was cast upon them..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/7days.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A tale of Struggle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&quot;..destiny won't stay idle as we fight it..&quot;</i></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/story.gif?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Follow the story of the nine protagonists and their journey to save the world. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/death.gif?t=1745270144\" /> <i><strong>&quot;Seven Days, Seven nights,</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>no more no less than one life</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>will be left in Your World..&quot; </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>.. one hope remains, hidden in Guardiah Tower, the power to escape Death's grasp..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/charactersfire.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All fated to die</strong> each character will play its part in the story as the events of the outside world and the journey inside Guardiah Tower are intertwined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/action.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>A <strong>story</strong> rich, <strong>action</strong> game with <strong>four distinct classes</strong> where every level offers new challenges  to keep your playthrough always <strong>fresh.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/steam1.gif?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each protagonist has its own <strong>unique style and abilities</strong>: Employ <strong>Stealth</strong>, <strong>Speed</strong>, reason to find <strong>Clever Solutions</strong>  or <strong>Fight your way</strong> to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lore, Secrets and Fun ! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/many.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">E<strong>xpand your knowledge</strong> of The Worlds in the library, discover the <strong>Nine bad endings </strong> while screwing up and enjoy the pleasure of <strong>Skipping\u00a0 Cutscenes</strong> to see what happens..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An Outstanding Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tim.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fate of Fire\u00a0 boasts 32 tracks composed by the amazing <strong>Tim Beek</strong>.<br>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replayable !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/humanity.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>High Replayability</strong> with <strong>Two Game Modes:</strong> &quot;<u>Classic</u>&quot; and &quot;<u>Runner</u>&quot; and <strong>Three Level Difficulties</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Have fun Saving Humanity !   </strong> <br><strong>Denis ^^</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/characters5.png?t=1745270144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Sight of Guardiah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e7505e49ec5b4debec76559da602ac987fdf9dba.jpg"},{"name":"A shared burden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/d5d96dd7ac0fb488cb1a04417f68f698c62ac733.jpg"},{"name":"The empty hall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/886ab8f1a107e532cc720dc799953a8e5318c4f5.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e62095132af19aa006186ca8df5cf7d21a49062b.jpg"},{"name":"Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/a97ed903719cf3b733fbec503a0bd611058894f4.jpg"},{"name":"Deaf Man Walking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/c36e60bead16777e8cb0f2ea5e2ce5a1dc638283.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/71bd3423af6c4cbca475d0fb2afe00bc144f2551.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/4e92c84098bb5479213b05c803a0b3bc4db22f4d.jpg"},{"name":"The Fate Changer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/8c5fbc055fa7ea5f3b09eda8f2f7f23c9f7c